     "```clojure\n(defn fixed-map\n  {:specialize [N T]\n   :requires [(const? N)]}\n  [xs :- (Array T N) f :- (Fn [T] T)]\n  (unroll N (fn [i] (aset xs i (f (aget xs i))))))\n```\n"}
