     "36caaca7f3f2510cd5ea36c375953a00f191e908765344fe1f8a31a2efdb2f97",
     :raw
     "Pure partial evaluation can run in hermetic mode. Effectful partial evaluation\nrequires `L12` build effects, grants, and replay records.\n"}
