     :raw
     "Replay-sensitive handlers must distinguish record mode from replay mode. In record mode, a handler may perform an allowed live effect and append a typed replay record. In replay mode, the handler must read the existing record and must not re-execute time, random, network, database, model-call, tool-call, `:ai/human-review`, workflow-event, or scheduler effects unless the profile explicitly defines a deterministic replay operation.\n"}
