     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "Additional facets may be added by packages, but package facets are subject to\nthe same manifest, compatibility, effect, profile, and conformance rules as\nstandard facets.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/3e793068e42b7eb37bdd1541",
