     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "Facet activation is lexical to the namespace unless a macro explicitly emits a\nnested activation with provenance. Importing a namespace does not implicitly\nenable all of that namespace's facets in the importer.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/44acc90744dc6f7d19efda70",
