      :end-byte 10834,
      :raw-sha256
      "9ee7ed03955b1fd8ab10b3609d0de4032fee0eaba87a469e021e570e657fe028"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/024-l14-language-facet-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "Facet rejection must happen as a source diagnostic, not as a backend crash or an\nunexplained missing symbol.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/684b834d83cc0fbbaf4f0dd7",
      :document-id "L14",
      :source-occurrence-id
