      :raw-sha256
      "c77135f0c28f0239b13af72d6894cce8f4932d2d58d73e2eaf6891b39222000e"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/024-l14-language-facet-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "```clojure\n{:facet/id :gravity.facet.workflow\n :version \"0.1.0\"\n :surface #{'workflow 'step 'activity 'signal}\n :profiles #{:hosted :native :distributed}\n :requires-facets #{:gravity.facet.schema}\n :runtime-effects #{:io/read :io/write :network/http}\n :build-effects #{:build/write-artifact :compiler/write-ir}\n :capabilities #{:workflow/scheduler :workflow/store :compiler/ir-transform}\n :lowers-to #{:gravity.core :gravity.ir.workflow}\n :artifacts #{:workflow/schema :workflow/replay-plan}\n :stability :experimental}\n```\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/72927f3b183c1184a6c5f0ec",
      :document-id "L14",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L14/source/d99168edfe77a855117e41d15d41c8d9550c21c3db3ddee5447c4f025a5f8bc5",
      :kind :semantic,
      :start-byte 934,
      :end-byte 1063,
      :raw-sha256
      "8ff702ad506192adeef21ea744bef396bcd10165f30a7b98b9299eecd2cb9d32"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/024-l14-language-facet-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "- A facet must declare its surface forms, profiles, effects, capabilities,\n  lowering targets, artifacts, and conformance tests.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/8585a1ebde09882f27c02529",
      :document-id "L14",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L14/source/59465aaff10cb7a4814356c2356a6fe179d17d578b9bcd7b98fe888d6d58771a",
      :kind :semantic,
      :start-byte 2793,
      :end-byte 3525,
      :raw-sha256
      "a69feb5a0240fa70598d8d539475a1edc0df512c8c8562dc1418b66052e42f76"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/024-l14-language-facet-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "- A facet is a named language extension with manifest metadata.\n- A facet form is source syntax owned by a facet.\n- A facet expander rewrites facet forms into Gravity forms or facet IR.\n- A facet checker validates domain rules not expressible in the base type system.\n- A facet IR is a typed domain representation such as EFIR, workflow IR, circuit\n  IR, query IR, UI IR, or prompt/tool IR.\n- A facet artifact is an emitted file, record, proof, schema, generated source,\n  backend input, or runtime manifest.\n- A facet boundary is the point where facet syntax enters or leaves ordinary\n  Gravity code.\n- A facet grant is permission to use facet-specific build effects, compiler IR\n  access, external tools, or runtime capabilities.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/9d9d4e789d4515c62d014551",
      :document-id "L14",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L14/source/8c0172668b2c2d8be01b589efe8066fb1d177e7b7cffd1ef5ad7305523ea5db2",
      :kind :semantic,
      :start-byte 10031,
      :end-byte 10724,
      :raw-sha256
      "f52a8a2deda3f9694f52afae70de5727cb14300a2a0a776e309243485e262e35"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/024-l14-language-facet-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
     :raw
     "- `:core` accepts only facets that lower fully to portable typed core.\n- `:hosted` may permit facets backed by hosted runtimes, reflection, or dynamic\n  loading when effects and capabilities are declared.\n- `:native` may permit facets that emit target-specific ABI, layout, vector, FFI,\n  or linker artifacts.\n- `:kernel`, `:firmware`, and `:hardware` require facets to avoid managed-runtime\n  assumptions unless those assumptions are modeled by the target.\n- `:distributed` requires replay-safe effects and deterministic workflow artifacts.\n- `:ai` requires model, prompt, tool, memory, and evaluation provenance.\n- `:meta` may inspect compiler internals only through declared compiler APIs.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/a0e68f8b1966c1cc96cb7807",
      :document-id "L14",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L14/source/1d70695df153bc9db12d0cace8ed3b12e9423c445128033e06d905d91dcf931e",
