      :raw-sha256
      "008b3957e04bb62aef270e04c733ed3b7e8bfa94933a223e01591a3cd46b146c"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/015-l5-type-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "0a7eacfe8745a47e07c3475276cc44337e27129945972370f20805ead2facd0c",
     :raw
     "The function must be closed to unaccounted callers. Retain its actual private\nvisibility, exports, definition, all resolved uses, calls, entries and parameter\nre-entry facts. Every normally invoking entry must independently establish a\ncomplete finite Keyword-key Map and validate all stored value types, including\nvalues ignored by `keys`. Entry shapes and value types may differ. Retain each\nactual argument source and type, its compatibility with the bare Map parameter,\nand the corresponding call facts; do not replace them with a common shape.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/1605a0a70da14f0ab34892b2",
      :document-id "L5",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L5/source/90c2d0dff0cbdbde7520d45a82d7a0f1908b137fa2f37306fca5ad7f278f6db2",
      :kind :semantic,
      :start-byte 7442,
      :end-byte 8000,
      :raw-sha256
      "4b50f3d1d9ca819d201ba3ec2800716c2bbee4ace07d6feb2ffbeaf2f7dff55e"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/015-l5-type-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "0a7eacfe8745a47e07c3475276cc44337e27129945972370f20805ead2facd0c",
     :raw
     "The parameter remains bare Map. The result is the existing homogeneous Keyword\nList, including when empty. This rule adds no Map or List annotation, common\nconstructor, key identity or presence, extent, cardinality, nonempty, flow or\nspecialization fact. Reconstruct the evidence at each consuming compiler stage\nand invalidate it when the function, parameter, `keys` use, callers, uses,\nvisibility, exports, argument sources or types, compatibility, binding, mutation\nor transfer facts change. Existing ownership, effects, capabilities, profile,\nsafety and "}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/6b8dacb39b4a695c81284b0f",
      :document-id "L5",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L5/source/66ab92c95377e29b1804587c86940d9010d6ee41143dafee471d70655f90b33c",
      :kind :semantic,
      :start-byte 6935,
      :end-byte 7441,
      :raw-sha256
      "3276fff2508b4e9a33132edf9561e33f2453f5444d9745490b8f15b0323ddb9c"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/015-l5-type-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "0a7eacfe8745a47e07c3475276cc44337e27129945972370f20805ead2facd0c",
     :raw
     "At least one normal entry is required. An empty Map is a valid normal witness\nbecause every one of its keys satisfies the domain. A Never argument in any\ncoordinate makes the whole call non-invoking and supplies no normal witness.\nUnknown, circular or unaccounted evidence and an all-non-invoking entry set do\nnot establish the domain. Public or external entry, escaping function values,\nmutation and recursive parameter re-entry require separate complete evidence;\nthey cannot be omitted from the census.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/aa8d33c82398011f30f5b37a",
      :document-id "L5",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "L5/source/2875ef4bfa730b0727bc4013ad1758ee622d48c933710c182b0ef4a2e04a908b",
      :kind :semantic,
      :start-byte 5998,
      :end-byte 6384,
      :raw-sha256
      "227037b8be48c2c24a705510f7ee2d451c09a704900ead48a6611d440183e05e"},
     :path
     "docs/phase-01-core-language/015-l5-type-system-specification.md",
     :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
     :file-sha256
     "0a7eacfe8745a47e07c3475276cc44337e27129945972370f20805ead2facd0c",
     :raw
     "For `keys` on an immutable bare Map parameter, local inference may establish\nthat every stored key is Keyword from complete private call-entry evidence.\nThis is a whole-key-domain obligation, separate from the selected-key presence\nrule above. A witness for one key, matching member-type vectors, an expected\nresult type or a family predicate does not establish the domain of all keys.\n"}
    {:facet
     {:id "facet/language/b8324e5c19c2a86f3f3d920a",
