      :field "Closing evidence:",
      :before-value
      "Real allowed operation and denied widening/revoked/wrong-phase operations. Enforce [SAFE10](../../docs/phase-02-safety/039-safe10-capability-security-model.md) intersection across source/function, package/dependency, workspace, profile, invocation/deployment and runtime scope. Reject undeclared ambient authority and forbidden declared ambient contexts; check each capability family's scope. Record parent/derived attenuation and lifetime without expansion; enforce provider-specific revocation or reject unsupported requirements unless a static lifetime substitute is valid. Separate build/runtime secrets and prevent public diagnostic, generated-code, cache-key and artifact leakage. Actual external model billing policy remains separate from removed project accounting.",
